   "version": "2.1.0",
   "description": "<p>4.1 update!</p>\n<ul>\n<li>no longer depends on Use Items Anywhere, but still works well with it!\n- now items will work inside the belt and one layer deep for using your medkits inside your rig/belt/pockets/etc.</li>\n<li>fixed toolmaster extra wide layout (Thank you Tron ❤️)</li>\n<li>added new ballistic armor plate case suggested by McDewgle (thank you AGAIN TRON ❤️)</li>\n</ul>\n",
